---
import SectionHeading from "./SectionHeading.astro";
---

<section
    id="experience"
    class="px-4 py-16 lg:py-0 lg:flex lg:flex-col lg:justify-center"
>
    <div class="max-w-screen-lg m-auto w-full gap-2 grid">
        <div>
            <SectionHeading index="02" title="Experience" />
            <ol class="relative border-s">
                <li class="mb-10 ms-6" data-reveal>
                    <span
                        class="absolute flex items-center justify-center w-6 h-6 bg-primary rounded-full -start-3 ring-8 ring-background"
                    >
                    </span>
                    <h3
                        class="flex items-center mb-1 text-lg font-semibold text-primary"
                    >
                        Centauro Solutions
                    </h3>
                    <time
                        class="block mb-2 text-base font-normal leading-none text-secondary"
                        >(3 months) September 2025 – November 2025
                    </time>
                    <p class="mb-4 text-base font-normal text-secondary">
                        At Centauro Solutions, I worked as a Frontend Developer Intern. My
                        main task was to improve the platform’s responsive
                        design to provide a better UX/UI for clients. I also
                        worked with the SCRUM methodology and used Git Flow for
                        version control, including releases, hotfixes, and code
                        reviews.
                    </p>
                </li>
                <li class="mb-10 ms-6" data-reveal>
                    <span
                        class="absolute flex items-center justify-center w-6 h-6 bg-primary rounded-full -start-3 ring-8 ring-background"
                    >
                    </span>
                    <h3
                        class="flex items-center mb-1 text-lg font-semibold text-primary"
                    >
                        Universidad de Costa Rica's Research and Development
                        (R&D) team
                    </h3>
                    <time
                        class="block mb-2 text-base font-normal leading-none text-secondary"
                        >1+ year (ongoing)</time
                    >
                    <p class="mb-4 text-base font-normal text-secondary">
                        In the R&D team, I work as a Full Stack Developer using technologies such as Laravel and React. We also use the SCRUM methodology, manage version control with GitHub, and work with Docker containers. We develop functional projects for the University of Costa Rica (UCR). Additionally, I work with CMS platforms like WordPress to manage the UCR website.
                    </p>
                </li>
            </ol>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
